    "default_locale": "ru",
    "notes": [
      "Colors are copied only from resource values that exist in the 8.5.2 APK.",
      "The dark theme is not a red-on-dark theme: the themed accent becomes light neutral (#e0e0e0) and lavender (#e8def8); brand red (#f04e4e) survives only as a constant and in a few direct references.",
      "Values are Android dp/sp. On a desktop at 96 dpi, treat 1 dp = 1 px at 100% scale, then apply the user's scale factor.",
      "line_height is not defined by the app for most text; only explicit lineSpacingExtra is recorded. UNKNOWN means the platform default was used."
    ]
